        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wacu kumae: I ka maeni, ma wuwacu pire kumae, En e uvuru, m’umbe dhanu man m’umbe lim, cil i adhura mi Yuda, man i gengi mi Yerusalem, ma gin uvuru, ma dhanu mbe ju m’ubedo i ie de mbe lim de mbe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
