          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mir udul uwacu kumae: Fodi kabedo mi jukwac ma giketho udul rombe migi vuto piny i ie bibedo nuti kakeni kendo, ma en e uvuru, ma dhanu mbe i ie yedi de mbe, man i adhurane ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I adhura mi ng’om gudi, i adhura mi poga, man i adhura ma yor ariwa ma piny, man i ng’om Benyamin, man i ka Yerusalem gbur, man i adhura mi Yuda, udul rombe bikadhu kendo the cing’ ng’atu m’ukwanu welgi, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
